| Default environments, callers and persisted data behave consistently | PASS — [independent-review.log](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/independent-review.log). Nine independent combinations use the real local datasource and instrumented key-value store. Production/staging default off and explicit opt-out perform zero preference reads across repository and manager APIs; explicit opt-in/development defaults honor overrides. Stored data survives unchanged. Docs describe the debug-feature policy rather than a blanket release-mode claim. |
| Required checks and applicable workflows pass | PASS — [tests.log](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/tests.log). Full host acceptance passes 4,371 tests / 14 skipped; format/analyzer and all seven actual PR checks pass ([ci.json](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/ci.json)). No affected manual-workflow or G3 security surface. Accepted/merged parity and refs/deliverable/epic gates are separately recorded. |

Format, analyzer and full suite passed: [format.log](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/format.log), [analyze.log](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/analyze.log), [tests.log](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/tests.log). All actual PR checks passed. The accepted source tree is identical to merged main: [tree-parity.log](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/tree-parity.log).

Independent reviews: [review.md](https://github.com/koniz-dev/flutter-starter/blob/evidence/docs/verification/issue-1212/review.md). Self-QA inspected the named artifacts, source assertions, refs and status labels before closing. No screenshots were collected (`--no-goldens`); no criterion rests on standing goldens or device/live-backend/store assurance.

